         "comprehends": [
          "copies/zc118hn1152.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Pencil, treble edge, five figures without separators. The second figure is the open-topped 8 of these hands, two strokes converging on one bottom bowl; read as 6 the day would be 26. The 4 is the most broken figure of the five. Both figures of the year match the 2 that opens the group."
        }
       ]
      }
     }
    },
